DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
12979::$$$message_0102_0000_0000$$$::I go to the residential area with many mansions lined up.[lr]::
12980::$$$message_0102_0000_0001$$$::I go up the hill, take a big detour around the familiar Tohsaka house, and go into the woods.[lr]::
12981::$$$message_0102_0000_0002$$$::The strong sunlight blinds me.[lr]::
12982::$$$message_0102_0000_0003$$$::I was able to find my destination easier than expected.::
12983::$$$message_0102_0001_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
12984::$$$message_0102_0001_0001$$$::So this is where the nickname of "Twin Mansions" comes from.[lr]::
12985::$$$message_0102_0001_0002$$$::The two mansions look too much alike.[lr]::
12986::$$$message_0102_0001_0003$$$::Even though I was just at Miyama, it gives me the illusion that I teleported to Shinto in just one step.[lr]::
12987::$$$message_0102_0001_0004$$$::But, if I look closely, it's different from the one in Shinto.[lr]::
12988::$$$message_0102_0001_0005$$$::...The view of an unfamiliar mansion in the night.[lr]::
12989::$$$message_0102_0001_0006$$$::What's in front of me is the mansion where the female mage and Servant are hiding without a doubt.::
12990::$$$message_0102_0002_0000$$$::"...There isn't anyone here, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]huh?"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
12991::$$$message_0102_0002_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Was I too late?[font italic=false][lr]::
12992::$$$message_0102_0002_0002$$$::The second floor is way too quiet.[lr]::
12993::$$$message_0102_0002_0003$$$::Had I arrived at this mansion sooner, the female mage might've been sleeping on that sofa around this time.::
12994::$$$message_0102_0003_0000$$$::"No, that wouldn't be true. There's no sign that there were people using this room."[lr]::
12995::$$$message_0102_0003_0001$$$::I investigate the room.[lr]::
12996::$$$message_0102_0003_0002$$$::There are three differences from the Shinto mansion.::
12997::$$$message_0102_0004_0000$$$::The bloodstains from half a year ago on the floor,[lr]::
12998::$$$message_0102_0004_0001$$$::the accessories that have fallen near the bloodstains,[lr]::
12999::$$$message_0102_0004_0002$$$::and the sixteen piece puzzle left on the table.::
13000::$$$message_0102_0005_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
13001::$$$message_0102_0005_0001$$$::The female mage named Bazett doesn't exist, but the bloodstains are definitely there.[lr]::
13002::$$$message_0102_0005_0002$$$::There are two things that I can think of this time.[lr]::
13003::$$$message_0102_0005_0003$$$::The first is that the female mage is a ghost who doesn't realize that she's dead or...::
13004::$$$message_0102_0006_0000$$$::"This isn't her base."[lr]::
13005::$$$message_0102_0006_0001$$$::There's an actual coffin elsewhere.[lr]::
13006::$$$message_0102_0006_0002$$$::This place is just where one falls into first.::
13007::$$$message_0102_0007_0000$$$::Someone's wish.[lr]::
13008::$$$message_0102_0007_0001$$$::The way to reenact the Holy Grail War.[lr]::
13009::$$$message_0102_0007_0002$$$::It's not enough to gather the ingredients.[lr]::
13010::$$$message_0102_0007_0003$$$::The world won't start moving just because the parts are gathered.[lr]::
13011::$$$message_0102_0007_0004$$$::If it were just everyday life, stopping the world would've been enough.[lr]::
13012::$$$message_0102_0007_0005$$$::But if we want to reenact the Holy Grail War, the battle won't be reenacted unless the thing that becomes the center moves.::
13013::$$$message_0102_0008_0000$$$::[font color=0x999999]                                ...You need to find your own meaning.::
13014::$$$message_0102_0009_0000$$$::In order to do that, he who grants wishes took on the shell of the cause that moves the world.[lr]::
13015::$$$message_0102_0009_0001$$$::It might be good enough just to borrow that point of view.[lr]::
13016::$$$message_0102_0009_0002$$$::If he keeps everyday life going, the fake Holy Grail Wars will also keep on going.[lr]::
13017::$$$message_0102_0009_0003$$$::Day and night don't overlap, but that force alone is interlinked.::
13018::$$$message_0102_0010_0000$$$::Because there were these four days, Bazett Fraga McRemitz's Holy Grail War is able to continue.[lr]::
13019::$$$message_0102_0010_0001$$$::On the other hand, if at least the Holy Grail War of the night continues, the observation of these four days can continue forever.::
13020::$$$message_0102_0011_0000$$$::[font color=0x999999]                                    No, there's only one fake person.::
13021::$$$message_0102_0012_0000$$$::But, one mistake was made.[lr]::
13022::$$$message_0102_0012_0001$$$::Just repeating everyday life.[lr]::
13023::$$$message_0102_0012_0002$$$::There's no need to start new things; a simple task to spend the reused four days.::
13024::$$$message_0102_0013_0000$$$::He felt that it was fun by some chance and intervened with strong will.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
13025::$$$message_0102_0013_0001$$$::Even though it would never be destroyed if it was incomplete.[lr]::
13026::$$$message_0102_0013_0002$$$::He was filling the holes himself, wanting to see new everyday life.[wm canskip=0]::
13027::$$$message_0102_0014_0000$$$::"Well, I found out who the Master was here, so all I have left is to come up with a strategy."[lr]::
13028::$$$message_0102_0014_0001$$$::Fortunately, there's a Servant who is more knowledgeable about the female mage than me.[lr]::
13029::$$$message_0102_0014_0002$$$::It's the job of the guard dog's lance to beat the war deity's sword.::
13030::$$$message_0102_0015_0000$$$::I leave the mansion.[lr]::
13031::$$$message_0102_0015_0001$$$::As a result of arriving at this hideout, I just pick up the accessories that were on the floor.[lr]::
13032::$$$message_0102_0015_0002$$$::As I leave, I look at the table one more time.::
13033::$$$message_0102_0016_0000$$$::The abandoned and fragmented picture.[lr]::
13034::$$$message_0102_0016_0001$$$::The puzzle that will never be finished is almost about to be completed.::

